# UI & data-testid

## Page layout

```tsx
<DataPageHeader testId="{module}-page-header" title="..." />
<MoBreadcrumbNav testId="{module}-breadcrumb" items={...} />
```

## Naming (kebab-case, English)

`{scope}-{entity}-{action|field}` — ví dụ `customers-create-btn`, `auth-login-email-input`

| Loại | Pattern |
|------|---------|
| Page | `{module}-page` |
| Input | `{module}-{field}-input` |
| Button | `{module}-{action}-btn` |
| Dialog | `{module}-{action}-dialog` |
| Alert | `{module}-{context}-alert` |
| Nav | `nav-{id}` |
| App shell | `app-toast-message`, `app-dialog-confirm-btn` |

Auth: `auth-login-*`, `auth-reset-*`

## Prop `testId` trên shared UI

Gắn **một lần** ở `Button`, `Input`, `DataPageHeader`, `ConfirmDialog`, `MoBreadcrumbNav`… Page chỉ truyền `testId="..."`.

**Không** dùng `id` HTML / class CSS làm selector E2E.

## Primitive mới

```tsx
<input data-testid={testId} />
```

Helper: `src/lib/test-id.ts`

## Checklist page mới

Root `{module}-page` · title · inputs/buttons · alert/dialog · `nav-*` · Playwright spec
